 * | OPT_SERIALIZER  | enum | Set the automatic data serializer.<br>`Redis::SERIALIZER_NONE`<br>`Redis::SERIALIZER_PHP`<br>`Redis::SERIALIZER_IGBINARY`<br>`Redis::SERIALIZER_MSGPACK`, `Redis::SERIALIZER_JSON`|
