 * | OPT_NULL_MULTIBULK_AS_NULL | bool | Causes PhpRedis to return `NULL` rather than `false` for NULL MULTIBULK replies |
 * | OPT_BACKOFF_ALGORITHM | enum | The exponential backoff strategy to use. |
